# Files excluded from the distributed plugin zip.
#
# Honoured by `wp dist-archive` and most WP build tooling. This repo has no
# packaging step of its own, so without this list the release zip is whatever
# the working directory happens to contain - and Plugin Check hard-errors on
# bin/i18n.sh ("application files are not permitted") plus every markdown file
# and dotfile in the root.
#
# Rule of thumb: if WordPress does not read it at runtime, it does not ship.
# vendor/ is dev-only here (phpstan and stubs); nothing in the plugin requires
# an autoloader, so it must not ship either.

# Version control and CI
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github
.distignore

# Build, test and analysis tooling
bin
gruntfile.js
package.json
package-lock.json
node_modules
composer.json
composer.lock
vendor
phpstan.neon
phpstan-baseline.neon
phpcs.xml
phpcs.xml.dist
tests

# Internal documentation and audit output. readme.txt is the customer-facing
# changelog; these are working notes and must not reach users.
audit
docs
qa-reports
CLAUDE.md
BUILD-LOG.md
WRAPPER-AUDIT.md
CHANGELOG.md
*.md

# Editor and OS noise
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
